# Applies to builds whose context is the repo root (court-service, dropin-service —
# both need shared/proto, so their context is the root rather than the service dir).
# Keep the tarball sent to the Docker daemon small: exclude build output, deps, VCS,
# and planning docs. Java source trees are tiny and stay in.

# Build output
**/target/
**/build/
**/*.jar
!**/.mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.jar

# Frontend deps / output (never needed by the Java image builds)
services/frontend/

# Go build artifacts
**/*.exe

# VCS + tooling
.git/
.github/
.idea/
.vscode/

# Project planning / notes (not part of any image)
.planning/
tasks/
*.md
